    "stdout": "T006 : ∀ (n : ℕ) (E : Set (GP.Space n)),\n  ((∀ (m : ℕ) (A : Set (GP.Space m)),\n        0 ≤ dimH A ∧\n          ∀ (s : ℝ),\n            0 < s →\n              GP.hausdorff s A = (MeasureTheory.Measure.hausdorffMeasure s) A ∧\n                (dimH A < ENNReal.ofReal s → GP.hausdorff s A = 0) ∧\n                  (ENNReal.ofReal s < dimH A → GP.hausdorff s A = ∞) ∧\n                    (GP.hausdorff s A = 0 → dimH A ≤ ENNReal.ofReal s) ∧\n                      (GP.hausdorff s A = ∞ → ENNReal.ofReal s ≤ dimH A)) ∧\n      ∀ (A : Set ℝ) (s : ℝ), 0 < s → GP.hausdorff s A = (MeasureTheory.Measure.hausdorffMeasure s) A) →\n    (dimH E < ∞ ∧\n        0 ≤ dimH E ∧\n          dimH E ≤ ↑n ∧\n            (n = 0 → E = Set.univ ∧ (∃ x, E = {x}) ∧ dimH E = 0) ∧ ∀ (s δ : ℝ), 0 < s → 0 < δ → GP.content s δ E < ∞) →\n      (n = 0 → dimH (GP.cylinder E) ≤ dimH E + 1) →\n        (1 ≤ n →\n            ∀ (q : ℝ),\n              dimH E < ENNReal.ofReal q →\n                ∀ (δ ε : ℝ),\n                  0 < δ → 0 < ε → GP.content (q + 1) δ (GP.cylinder E) ≤ ENNReal.ofReal (2 * √2 ^ (q + 1) * ε)) →\n          dimH (GP.cylinder E) ≤ dimH E + 1 ∧ dimH (GP.cylinder E) < ∞\n'Translation.T006' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n",
